 613 070215* 6362          MLC                             /ENABLE ALL OUTPUT LINES
 614 070216* 4503          JMS I   PROWLOAD/[ROWLOAD]      /CALL ROWTABLE AND REGISTER LOAD ROUTINE
 615 070217* 4544          JMS I   PCLR23/[CLR23]          /CLEAR FIELDS 2, 3 (AND BITS IN 13705, 13707)
 616 070220* 6271          CDF     70                      /BACK TO OUR FIELD
 617 070221* 7344          NL7776                          /-2
 618 070222* 3010          DCA     XR0                     /SETUP COUNTER
 619 070223* 3011  VAGAIN, DCA     XR1                     /CLEAR TIME-OUT COUNTER
 620 070224* 6061  VWATLP, VSF                             /VIDEO RETRACE FLAG UP?
 621 070225* 7410          SKP                             /SKIP IF NOT
 622 070226* 5232          JMP     VPAST                   /JUMP IF SO
 623 070227* 2011          ISZ     XR1                     /WAITING TOO LONG?
 624 070230* 5224          JMP     VWATLP                  /NO, KEEP GOING
 625 070231* 5214          JMP     PRGDONE                 /YES, GO DO IT ALL OVER AGAIN
