 630 070235* 7200          CLA                             /CLEAN UP
 631 070236* 2010          ISZ     XR0                     /DONE IT ENOUGH TIMES?
 632 070237* 5223          JMP     VAGAIN                  /NO, GO DO IT AGAIN
