 641               /       AUTOMATIC PRODUCT TEST DOWNLOAD MODE.  THIS COULD  BE  A SECONDARY CALL TO THE
 642               /       DOWNLOAD  ROUTINE IF A PREVIOUSLY LOADED ROUTINE EXITED VIA  A  PANEL  REQUEST
 643               /       INSTEAD OF HLT.
