 728 070333* 1044          TAD     T2                      /GET CURRENT FIELD
 729 070334* 7001          IAC                             /TENTATIVELY ADD ONE
 730 070335* 0110          AND     Z20/[20]                /CHECK IF AT LAST FIELD
 731 070336* 7650          SNA CLA                         /SKIP IF SO
 732 070337* 5347          JMP     CPMTST                  /JUMP IF NOT
