 746               /       CHECK IF WE ARE ABOUT TO START TESTING CP MEMORY.
 747               
 748 070347* 1044  CPMTST, TAD     T2                      /GET CURRENT FIELD
 749 070350* 0105          AND     Z10/[10]                /CHECK IF INTO CP GROUP
 750 070351* 7650          SNA CLA                         /SKIP IF SO
 751 070352* 5323          JMP     MTSTLP                  /KEEP GOING
 752 070353* 1041          TAD     TINC                    /GET INCREMENTAL FACTOR
 753 070354* 7710          SPA CLA                         /SKIP IF STILL POSITIVE
 754 070355* 5366          JMP     NEGTST                  /JUMP IF NOT
