 757               /       TESTING OF FIELD 0 AND FIELD 1.
 758               
 759 070356* 1044          TAD     T2                      /GET LATEST FIELD
 760 070357* 0104          AND     Z7/[7]                  /JUST FIELD BITS
 761 070360* 7650          SNA CLA                         /SKIP IF NOT AT ZERO
 762 070361* 7305          NL002A                          /ELSE START HERE
