 822               /       SHOULD BE CPEND-CPINT  INSTEAD  OF  CPEND2-CPLOAD.   THIS LENGTH MAY INTERFERE
 823               /       WITH AUTOMATIC PRODUCT TESTING  OR  CAUSE  SOME OTHER BUG.  IT IS NOT KNOWN AT
 824               /       THIS TIME IF THE ORIGINAL PROGRAMMER'S INTENTION WAS TO OVERLAY ANY OTHER CODE
