1738               /       STORE  DISPLAY  STRING  ROUTINE.    CALL WITH CLEAR AC TO  DISPLAY  VALUES  IN
1739               /       ARGUMENT LIST OR WITH 0040 IN AC TO BLANK THE FIELD.    IN-LINE  ARGUMENT IS A
1740               /       POINTER TO THE ARGUMENT LIST.  LIST FORMAT IS 0000 IF ITEMS  ARE  FOR FIELD 2,
1741               /       OR  4000  IF  ITEMS ARE FOR FIELD 3.  RELATIVE STORAGE ADDRESS FOR  SUBSEQUENT
1742               /       ITEMS  FOLLOWS  THE  0000  OR  4000.  ALL OTHER ITEMS ARE SEQUENTIAL VALUES TO
1743               /       STORE INTO  THE  BUFFER  STARTING  AT  THE  GIVEN  ADDRESS.  ALL ADDRESSES ARE
1744               /       RELATIVE TO THE ABSOLUTE  VALUE  0205,  NOT  THE  ACTUAL  ROW ADDRESS WHICH IS
1745               /       ALWAYS SOME NUMBER OF WHOLE  PAGES  DIFFERENT.    ADDRESSES  NEAR THE END OF A
1746               /       FIELD WILL NOT BE CORRECTED TO  THE  NEXT  FIELD.  THE ARGUMENT LIST ENDS WITH
1747               /       7777.  CONTROL RETURNS PAST THE IN-LINE POINTER ARGUMENT.
