2303 072764* 0077  L77,    77                              /CONSTANT 0077
2304               /      SUBROUTINE TO CLEAR THE ATTRIBUTE BITS OF CP  13705 AND 13707.  THIS MAKES THE
2305               /       CORRESPONDING LINES NORMAL WIDTH AND HEIGHT.
